# roadmap Phase 6: dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/practice.lua over a played game (PLAY=1, 16000
# frames). practice_probe.lua logs game_time, the quarter and the score every 2000 frames in
# play, and "shot clock ran out" if shotimer reaches 0,0 while a shot clock runs. Without the
# script (measured with the probe alone) the clock runs, the first quarter ends and the shot
# clock runs out by frame 3594 (NBA JAM 1993) to 7224 (SE). With it the clock stays at 3:00.0
# (03000000) in the first quarter on every game and the shot clock never runs out, while
# play goes on (the score still changes).
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/practice.lua
extra practice_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse nbajam nbamht nbahangt
frames 16001
env PLAY=1
once practice: game clock frozen
once practice: no shot clock
log clock 03000000 quarter 0
nolog quarter 1
nolog shot clock ran out
